            "action_name": {
              "value": "Inflict Misery"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, enchantment, mental, occult)\n\nThe misery siktempora fills the target's thoughts with abject despair. The target must attempt a DC 32 Will save. Regardless of outcome, the target is then immune to Inflict Misery for 1 minute.\n\nSuccess: The target is unaffected.\nFailure: The target is clumsy 2, enfeebled 2, and stupefied 2 for 1 round.\nCritical Failure: As failure, but for 1 minute."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
